Syntax: set trap arrow <container|door> <arrow>

Set Arrow Trap allows a skilled thief to rig a container or door with a
concealed arrow that will fire when the trap is triggered. The arrow must
be in your inventory and will be consumed when setting the trap.

When an unsuspecting victim opens the trapped container or door, the arrow
fires at them, potentially causing significant damage. The quality of the
arrow affects the damage dealt, and poisoned arrows retain their venom.

More skilled trappers can set deadlier traps that are harder to detect and
more likely to strike true. Failed attempts may trigger the trap prematurely,
potentially injuring the trapper themselves.

Class: Thief
Discipline: Traps

